WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.727
Drew sighed. "I have nothing to do," he said.

2
00:00:13.728 --> 00:00:17.743
"I'm so bored!"

3
00:00:17.744 --> 00:00:23.714
He lay on the sofa and stared up at the ceiling.

4
00:00:23.715 --> 00:00:30.146
Dad walked into the living room.

5
00:00:30.147 --> 00:00:34.368
"What are you doing, Drew?" Dad asked.

6
00:00:34.369 --> 00:00:38.181
"I'm bored," said Drew.

7
00:00:38.182 --> 00:00:40.852
"Bored?" said Dad.

8
00:00:40.853 --> 00:00:44.654
"There's nothing to do," said Drew.

9
00:00:44.655 --> 00:00:47.517
He slid off the sofa.

10
00:00:47.518 --> 00:00:50.801
His feet were still on the sofa.

11
00:00:50.802 --> 00:00:55.173
But his head was now under the coffee table.

12
00:00:55.174 --> 00:01:03.715
"Hmm," said Dad. "Come with me."

13
00:01:03.716 --> 00:01:08.612
Drew followed Dad to the kitchen.

14
00:01:08.613 --> 00:01:12.675
"These dishes are dirty," said Dad.

15
00:01:12.676 --> 00:01:22.244
"Since you have nothing to do, you can wash them."

16
00:01:22.245 --> 00:01:29.794
"Ugh," said Drew.

17
00:01:29.795 --> 00:01:36.453
He filled the sink with hot, soapy water.

18
00:01:36.454 --> 00:01:41.770
Then he got to work.

19
00:01:41.771 --> 00:01:47.950
When Drew was done, he went back to the living room.

20
00:01:47.951 --> 00:01:50.986
"Oh, hi, Drew," said Dad.

21
00:01:50.987 --> 00:01:55.227
"I was going to vacuum the living room.

22
00:01:55.228 --> 00:02:03.539
But since you're bored today, you can do it."

23
00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:12.777
Drew vacuumed the living room.

24
00:02:12.778 --> 00:02:20.322
Next he helped Dad weed the garden.

25
00:02:20.323 --> 00:02:33.909
Then he peeled potatoes and set the table.

26
00:02:33.910 --> 00:02:37.041
During dinner Drew was tired.

27
00:02:37.042 --> 00:02:41.178
"That was a busy day," he said.

28
00:02:41.179 --> 00:02:46.119
Dad smiled. "Anytime you're bored, just let me know!"

29
00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:56.254
Drew laughed. "I'll never say I'm bored again!"

